<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoTokenAssignFromInteger</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to set a token to indicate an
    integer</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoTokenAssignFromInteger(
    SilikoToken *object,
    long long int right_side);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoTokenAssignFromInteger</function> function
sets the object pointed to by <varname>object</varname> to indicate an
integer token with the value of <varname>right_side</varname>.</para>
</refsection>
